      "merged_at": null
    },
    "body": "## Summary\n- add a real-world Packrift ecommerce carton fixture to the packer tests\n- keep the existing bom-d-van fixture but assert packing invariants instead of exact equal-volume item ordering\n- add helper assertions for packed item names and out-of-bounds placements\n\n## Validation\n- `PATH=/Users/farhan/Downloads/packrift-backlinks/execution/toolchains/go1.25.10/bin:$PATH GO111MODULE=off go test -timeout 20s`\n- GOPATH-mode `go test -timeout 20s ./...`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nThe Packrift fixture source is public and dimensions/weights are kept inline in the test: https://packrift.github.io/packaging-optimization-benchmark-corpus/cartonization-solver-fixtures.html",
    "closed_by": null,
